{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overcome your past and become someone new. A game about love, loss and being lost in life.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Truer than You, you play as 26-year old non-binary Rin who\u2019s recently moved to a big city to start their new life and a new position at the secretive company Truer than You, specializing in renting out actors for real life situations.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it\u2019s up to you to do your gigs without breaking the company rules or becoming exposed. You'll navigate situations by making choices and having conversations to get a good rating. Maybe you'll even become employee of the month!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But playing someone else isn\u2019t always easy. Sometimes you\u2019ll end up in situations where the borders start to blur. You might even meet someone that you start caring a little extra for\u2026 Then, what do you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, as Rin gets on with their new endeavours, their past is catching up with them. Why did they leave thir old life behind, to start a new life as someone else? In time, they\u2019ll have to deal with who they are and will become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Explore relationships and dilemmas connected to authenticity and roles in society </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Form deeper relationships with three different characters and reveal their back stories <br>\ud83d\udc8e Queer-friendly cast of characters and relationship types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Choose from more than 1,100 options leading to multiple endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Flowing conversation mechanic - decide when to speak (or not)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gig worker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/54fbcfbf4e0dc077130e63f7c7a759633e5443ae.jpg"},{"name":"Full score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/0a0425a5778e29d7ebbfba2cb85b3c0c11f39d3a.jpg"},{"name":"Who\u2019s that?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/10188c3816446052ab074bfaad62f45592ab6235.jpg"},{"name":"Thief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/019fc23bc54cac19748218d15cebf92fc856d805.jpg"},{"name":"Rambler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/8e7dcfe52eb78bfde003e82eff72ff49545556bd.jpg"},{"name":"Shoplifter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/07170c5e9071eb805d1dbeb84b62ddba2091aed7.jpg"},{"name":"Love in the big city","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/7b72e0dabe4d9496d0f3ceece58abf1def6ed617.jpg"},{"name":"Friendzone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/18457b5e69d6a6c6c35091afc9732124f361d9cb.jpg"},{"name":"Activist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/ee78b63154f76b74ccbea3b55a82459ea0addc7e.jpg"},{"name":"Toothpaste","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2161830/bb7f75cf93d6051ddd1ca453fc1c638e7c168f00.jpg"}],"total":34},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2161830?t=1770993012","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2161830?t=1770993012","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770993012","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770993012","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"The game contains mentions of and references to sex, non-explicit sexual content in written form, veiled nudity (above chest), instances of alcohol and substance use, and mature language. The game contains themes that might be triggering, such as mentions of suspected suicide. "},"demos":[{"appid":3345720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Overcome your past and become someone new. A game about love, loss and being lost in life.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/efad5afed75779bfd7cb7b16632a9428.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Truer than You, you play as 26-year old non-binary Rin who\u2019s recently moved to a big city to start their new life and a new position at the secretive company Truer than You, specializing in renting out actors for real life situations.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/8a2a58eff11aee331a5d82b8ef2ad53a.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it\u2019s up to you to do your gigs without breaking the company rules or becoming exposed. You'll navigate situations by making choices and having conversations to get a good rating. Maybe you'll even become employee of the month!? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.poster.avif?t=1770993012\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.webm?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/fcb167bd729e68824628d6ef3b3d0ae6.mp4?t=1770993012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But playing someone else isn\u2019t always easy. Sometimes you\u2019ll end up in situations where the borders start to blur. You might even meet someone that you start caring a little extra for\u2026 Then, what do you do?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, as Rin gets on with their new endeavours, their past is catching up with them. Why did they leave thir old life behind, to start a new life as someone else? In time, they\u2019ll have to deal with who they are and will become. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161830/extras_big/5aab2a32ca9e47d682b1b1c3f54c5ccb.avif?t=1770993012 width=800 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Explore relationships and dilemmas connected to authenticity and roles in society </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e Form dee